  trashHints:
  - 'I think I saw something lying in the mountains. Looked like there used to be
    food inside. + Maybe the seagulls brought it there. '
  - "Last week, I tried to build a sandcastle and almost cut myself \xA7 on something
    silver in the sand\u2026"
  - 'I saw something rusting near the lookout on the mountain. Who knows how long
